  "description": "🚴Powerful lighting configuration: left and right turn signals, brake lights, rear taillights, and headlights.\nThe EB5 Roamer boasts a powerful lighting configuration that includes left and right turn signals, brake lights, rear taillights, and front headlights. These high-performance lights ensure enhanced visibility and safety during nighttime rides, allowing you to navigate your surroundings with ease. Jasion's exclusive design of the left and right turn signals distinguishes it from other electric bikes on the market, marking a pioneering achievement. With the simple flick of a switch on the handlebars, you can signal your intentions to people behind you, further safeguarding your commuting experience. Even when the lighting system is inactive, the left and right turn signals can still remain illuminated, providing an added layer of awareness and protection throughout your journey.\n\n🚲 Quick-release built-in Samsung/LG battery 48V 11A; Battery UL2271 and vehicle UL2849 safety certification.\nPlus, with its fast charging technology, the battery can be fully charged in just 4-5 hours. You can conveniently start charging the battery when you return home after your daily commute. By the time you finish dinner and prepare for bed, the battery is fully charged and ready for your next adventure.\n\n🚴♂️ 1200W high power motor, 60 Nm torque.\n⚡ Speed up to 28 miles, super long cruising range of 62 miles.\n🌟 Equipped with front suspension system and four electronic control systems.\n🌈 26\" x 2.25\" run-proof Michelin tires, maximum load capacity 300 lbs.\n📌 Color options: black, green, blue, white, grass green.",
